               <div class="title-text" tabindex="0">Swim Classes For the Entire Family</div>
           </div>
       </div>
        <div class="description-text text" tabindex="0">
            <p>Red Cross swim lessons help children &amp; adults&nbsp;gain water safety and swimming skills. Ages 6 months – adult.</p>

        </div>
        
        <div class="panel-button generic-panel-button">
            

<div class="redcross-button left" data-context="redcross-button">
    
    <a data-aa-link-button="link button not set" class=" button red  medium " href="/get-help/how-to-prepare-for-emergencies/types-of-emergencies/water-safety/water-safety-training-provider.html">
