        <div class="promo-info ">
            
            <div class="description top-description text"><p><b><span class="red-text">Help Your Family Be Safer in and Around Water.</span></b> Children and adults can learn to be safer in and around water with Swim by the American Red Cross. Knowing how to swim is exciting and opens the door to many opportunities, but water is not without risk. Learning to enjoy the water safely should be the first step for anyone who will be around water. Have fun learning water safety in an engaging way with video and activities for kids and families. Track your kids’ progress with this FREE app as they learn to swim.<br />
</p>
